{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Come find me...</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/title_anim_1920_1080.gif?t=1753793943\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Elemental Soul</strong> is a 2D side-scrolling roguelite action RPG centered around elemental-switching combat and limitless item collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Three Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/element_hit.gif?t=1753793943\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the world of Elemental Soul, there are three main elements: <strong>Fire, Grass, and Water</strong>. Players can harness this mysterious <strong>power</strong>. With the right element, you can gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>And if it\u2019s at just the right moment\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapons and Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/relic_test.gif?t=1753793943\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On your journey, you may discover <strong>treasure</strong> chests. Inside, you can find one of hundreds (or soon-to-be hundreds) of <strong>weapons and relics</strong> with diverse abilities. You can carry up to three weapons, and infinitely absorb relics to grow stronger.<br>Discover powerful synergies and craft your optimal build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/kid_talk.gif?t=1753793943\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you adventure, you\u2019ll make <strong>choices</strong> that shape your path. Your decisions affect stages, future storylines, appearing bosses, and village NPCs. Even unexpected actions may lead to massive changes later!<br>So take your time to explore and uncover <strong>hidden secrets and untold tales</strong> throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/ElementalSoul2025-06-1716-47-55-Trim-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1753793943\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeating a stage boss allows you to move on to the next chapter of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylish 2D pixel art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Element-based action combat with a hint of Soulslike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of weapons and relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story and choices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Release Plan</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coming soon via update</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776880?t=1753793943","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776880?t=1753793943","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/351cf07873980ae68470bf4f65f76de9accbeb63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753793943","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/351cf07873980ae68470bf4f65f76de9accbeb63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753793943","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Come find me...</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/title_anim_1920_1080.gif?t=1753793943\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Elemental Soul</strong> is a 2D side-scrolling roguelite action RPG centered around elemental-switching combat and limitless item collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Three Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/element_hit.gif?t=1753793943\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the world of Elemental Soul, there are three main elements: <strong>Fire, Grass, and Water</strong>. Players can harness this mysterious <strong>power</strong>. With the right element, you can gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>And if it\u2019s at just the right moment\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapons and Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/relic_test.gif?t=1753793943\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On your journey, you may discover <strong>treasure</strong> chests. Inside, you can find one of hundreds (or soon-to-be hundreds) of <strong>weapons and relics</strong> with diverse abilities. You can carry up to three weapons, and infinitely absorb relics to grow stronger.<br>Discover powerful synergies and craft your optimal build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/kid_talk.gif?t=1753793943\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you adventure, you\u2019ll make <strong>choices</strong> that shape your path. Your decisions affect stages, future storylines, appearing bosses, and village NPCs. Even unexpected actions may lead to massive changes later!<br>So take your time to explore and uncover <strong>hidden secrets and untold tales</strong> throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/extras/ElementalSoul2025-06-1716-47-55-Trim-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1753793943\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeating a stage boss allows you to move on to the next chapter of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylish 2D pixel art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Element-based action combat with a hint of Soulslike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of weapons and relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story and choices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Release Plan</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coming soon via update</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","developers":["Star-Ring"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776880/d0069860b5b43bad8b889c9f71799ec5647150cb/header.jpg?t=1753793943","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 G